message: If you use this protocol, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: The Open Source Protocol
abstract: >-
  A protocol for declaring, in a website's HTML head, where the site's source
  code is hosted and how to report bugs for it. Based on the Open Graph protocol.
